===Noun===
{{en-noun|leishmaniases}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} Any of various [[ulcerative]] skin diseases caused by any of the [[protozoa]]ns of the genus ''[[Leishmania]]'', transmitted to humans and animals by bloodsucking [[sandfly|sandflies]].

